      "text": "EyeCaneTM\nAR Glasses \nProduct Summary \nEyeCaneTM AR Glasses combine augmented reality (AR) \nand artificial intelligence (Al) to assist individuals with \nlow vision, including those affected by macular \ndegeneration, glaucoma, diabetic retinopathy, and \ncataracts and other conditions.\nEquipped with a �K autofocus camera, EyeCaneTM works \nwith the EyeCaneTM mobile app. The AR lens analyzes \nvisual defects in real-time, and the camera captures and \noverlays images on the user's remaining vision. \nCustomized filters can optimize the visual experience.\nEyeCaneTM also uses Vision AI to recognize text, objects, \nand people, providing audio guidance to support daily \ntasks and enhance independence.\nThe Smartest Way \nto Support Individuals \nwith Vision Loss\n"
    },
