      "text": "Product \nBenefits\n�. Enhanced Visual Independence\nEyeCaneTM AR Glasses help low-vision users regain \nindependence by compensating for missed visual \ninformation, enabling safer exploration of their \nsurroundings.\n�. Convenience in Daily Life\nWith features like text recognition, object \nidentification, and voice guidance, users can easily \nnavigate daily tasks, such as reading menus or \ndetecting obstacles.\n�. Customized Visual Assistance\nPersonalized image filters are tailored to each user's \nvisual field loss, providing an optimized experience.\n�. Efficient Symptom Management\nCellico’s visual field testing feature allows users to \ntrack changes in their visual condition, which can \nhelp alleviate fatigue and anxiety caused by long \nwaiting times during hospital visits.\n�. Increased Social Participation\nEyeCaneTM AR Glasses enhance social engagement by \nexpanding opportunities for low-vision users, \npromoting new experiences and stronger \nrelationships.\nStart your new visual experience \nwith EyeCaneTM AR Glasses.\n"
